window.products.push({"id":760052,"name":"Large Double Layer Bamboo Bread Box,Natural Bread Storage box for Kitchen Countertop,Farmhouse Bread Storage Holder Basket with Clear Window and Adjus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mtw3kTvJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LARGE SIZE】:Approximate Dimensions (in inches): 16\"(length)x 9.25\"(Width)x 13\"(Height),Easily enough to hold 5-10 loaves of bread, the large compartment at the bottom of the bread box provides a spacious storage for oversized bread. It is also perfect for storing potatoes, onions or kitchen utensils! Let your kitchen no longer be messy, enjoy your time in the kitchen. 【100% natural bamboo】 This bread box is made of high-quality natural bamboo, which is more environmentally friendly and healthier; it is much more durable than fragile canned or plastic bread racks. Waterproof, durable, non-staining, and chemical-free. Natural bamboo materials are used to ensure the safety and health of food for you and your family. The unique air outlet design maintains proper moisture and keeps food fresh and crispy. 【Unique Design】 Built-in a transparent acrylic glass window, so you can easily see everything inside, no need to open the door to know the rest of the bread, the window decoration will also be a great decoration for your kitchen storage. And putting a lid on keeps bread and pastries fresh during the day and night, and protects your baked goods from curious pets, rodents, or insects. 【Easy to assemble and multifunctional】 This bread box is easy to assemble, contains installation instructions and detailed steps, and can be completed in a few minutes with a screwdriver. Be sure to install as required and control the intensity. The large bread box is designed with two layers, and the bamboo partition wall makes the bread box two layers, which effectively avoids the deformation of the bread due to extrusion. The detachable layer can be used to cut bread. 【Best Service】If you are not satisfied with this bread box, you can replace it or get a full refund. Any questions will be replied within 24 hours. Hope our products can bring more happiness to your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mtw3kTvJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HI&HONOR","source_asin":"B0962YY56Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0962YY56Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0962YY56Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
