window.products.push({"id":760152,"name":"2.38Gal/9L Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room, TISKY Cool Mist Ultrasonic Top Fill 4 speed Humidifier with Humidistat for Home Plant Office Wholehouse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tkmrZ2goL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Capacity Home Humidifiers】With 9L/ 2.38gal water tank, the cool mist humidifiers provides fast relief in rooms as small as 650ft², also can satisfy up to 2000 sq ft. Only filled with water once, continuously output cool mist 24 hours with maximum spay. Undoubtedly the ideal tower humidifiers for Large room, Bedroom, Living room, Nursery, Yoga Room, Plants etc. 【Humanized Design】Features adjustable 4 Speed Humidistat, 1-16H timers, built-in humidistat sensor, customized humidity 45%-95%, intermittent spray (1M 3M 5M), remote control & touch button works both, just one touch to choose the air way you like. When the setting humidity reaches bedroom humidifier will automatically stop humidification, on the contrary lower than will re-open humidification. 【Long-lasting and Noiseless】One fill last up to 90 hours, no need to refill frequently. Pour water through the water enter net which on the top cover, it will auto flow into water tank, no need bending over! Large diameter standing humidifier, easy to clean, dry with a cloth. HD display with Sleep Mode can be controlled remotely, the floor humidifier is running smoothly (<30 dB), undisturbed by sound and light for kids, seniors & sensitive sleepers. 【Safe to Use and Durability】Visual water level gauge convenient to check the water status.There is no water in the tank, home humidifier will automatically shut down to prevent damage and ensure your safety, equipped with a ceramic stone filter (no need to replace). Designed with carrying portable handle, strong load-bearing capacity, convenient to move anywhere. 【Satisfactory Policy】 360° rotating adjustable nozzle allows mist to disperse in any direction, convenient to control the humidity level of room, bringing us fresh air. We care about customer experience with our products, please contact us immediately with any questions, we are always ready to help you, 7*24 hours customer service, 30 days free replacement, one year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tkmrZ2goL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tisky","source_asin":"B0B7W16YK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7W16YK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7W16YK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":760153,"name":"Rekall Dynamics Professional IN USE SIGN. A professional In Use Light for Television, Radio, Music & Broadcast Studios. (Low Voltage: 12-24vDC)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sp3zP8WnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Rekall Dynamics IN USE SIGN enclosure is the result of years of experience working with some of the worlds largest Broadcast, Government, Military and Professional Healthcare Organisations supplying a range of top of the line warning lights for Demanding Environments.   Our products are used across many industries worldwide, you are purchasing the exact same unit we have supplied to companies like Bose, Dolby, Pinewood, Film Roman, and even NASA and Facebook.   - Moulded Aluminium Anodised Housing.  - IP55 rated Liquid and Chemical Resistant Seal.  - 14 SMD5640 LED Ultra Daylight Active Wafer Matrix Illumination.  - Impact & Fade Resistant, Chemical Safe Polycarbonate Graphic Panel.  - Self Contained Miniaturised Internal Power Module.  - Extruded Illuminated Front Display Panel allows viewing from side on.  - Stainless Steel fitting and Assembly Hardware.  - Internal single piece 5mm Silicone Dust, Water and Chemical Seal.  - Pre-Drilled Rear Mounting Options using Standard Pattern  - Included Accessory Kit with Mounting Hardware and Access Tool. Why choose the Rekall Dynamics IN USE SIGN ? Our warning signs, including our world famous JUDD brand can be found worldwide in all sorts of environments from Broadcast Facilities to the US Defence Force, Hospitals and Medical Facilities around the world and even outside the meeting rooms at Facebook.  It takes a lot to be trusted by Defence Forces around the world and even NASA choose to use our products in their facilities. Knowing that our products have proven themselves in some of the most challenging environments on the planet Rekall Dynamics is the obvious choice when looking for the best Recording Sign and Warning Light solutions available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sp3zP8WnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rekall Dynamics","source_asin":"B01259U8XM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01259U8XM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01259U8XM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
