window.products.push({"id":760274,"name":"Ginkgo International Lafayette 4-Piece Stainless Steel Hostess Serving Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HpMGZtz5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description 079914360319 Features: -18/10 stainless steel. -Dishwasher safe. -Hammered finish. Product Type: -Hostess / Serving Set. Primary Material: -Stainless Steel Flatware. Handle Pattern: -Ornate. Handle Material: -Stainless Steel. Dimensions: Overall Length - Top to Bottom: -8.06\". Overall Length - Top to Bottom: -7.13\". Amazon.com This four-piece hostess set complements Lafayette, one of Ginkgo's top-selling stainless-steel flatware patterns. Lafayette strikes a popular chord by taking elegant, slender handles with rounded tab ends and finishing them with a hammered yet smooth surface on both the tops and undersides. Unlike the squared bowls of the place setting, the serving spoons feature traditional egg-shaped bowls. Perfect for spooning gravy, cream sauces, or syrup, the horizontal bowl of the ladle is not too shallow and not too deep. Made of 18/10 stainless steel in a bright mirror finish, the serving pieces, like the place settings, feature a medium-weight, nicely balanced heft. The hostess set includes the following: 9-inch serving spoon; 9-inch pierced spoon; 8-1/4-inch cold meat fork; and 7-inch ladle. Sure to be used on a regular basis, the set is conveniently dishwasher-safe. A family-owned business since 1977, Ginkgo International is dedicated to quality design and value when it comes to flatware for the home. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 1 hostess set. The set includes: 9-inch serving spoon; 9-inch pierced spoon; 8-1/4-inch cold meat fork; and 7-inch ladle. 4 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HpMGZtz5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ginkgo","source_asin":"B0007ZQCBO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007ZQCBO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007ZQCBO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":760275,"name":"Smorstix SMORPAK 40004 S'More Making Kit (4 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x8h4MHPTL._AC_SL1290_.jpg","description":"Whether it's over a campfire or hanging out by the backyard fire pit, there is nothing like the taste of warm s'mores as they melt in your mouth! Each Smorpak has the ingredients and supplies to make ten s'mores. Included in the Smorpak is four Smorstix, made of 100% untreated white birch, ten packs of premium chocolate bars, a package of scrumptious graham crackers and a package of fresh marshmallows for roasting. Smorpaks are great for picnics, barbecues, campfires or fireplaces and are fun for the whole family. In addition to the traditional summer campfire activity, s'mores are a great treat during the Fall and Winter months; after you finish the corn maze, picking pumpkins, skiing, ice skating, tubing or sledding. All outdoor activities are more enjoyable when you end with a sweet treat like a s'more. The Smorpak 4 Pak gives you 4 smorpaks - enough to make 40 s'mores! Now that IS a sweet treat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x8h4MHPTL._AC_SL1290_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smorstix","source_asin":"B017JWAWJA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017JWAWJA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017JWAWJA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":760276,"name":"La Pastiche Sunflower Collage Framed Hand Painted Original Artwork With Burgeon Gold Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":459.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Vbn-ZlNfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sunflower Collage is a handcrafted reimagining of Vincent Van Gogh's timeless originals, Imperial Crown Fritillaries in a Copper Vase and Vase with Twelve Sunflowers. One of two distinctly expressive La Pastiche collages featuring these two works, this piece maintains the bright turquoise backdrop, flattened perspective, and golden vase of the latter. In describing his now immediately recognizable series of sunflower paintings, Vincent Van Gogh wrote, â€œYouâ€™ll see that these canvases will catch the eye. [â€¦] Itâ€™s a type of painting that changes its aspect a little, which grows in richness the more you look at it.â€ This combined composition maintains his mastery of and fascination with color. The vivid blue and green hues make vibrant complements to the warm blossoms. This set of colors is prototypical Van Gogh and would reemerge in his later paintings â€œWheatfield with Crowsâ€, â€œBedroom in Arlesâ€, and even â€œThe Starry Nightâ€. Luxury brand La Pastiche seeks out today's most skilled artists and finest materials to produce stunning tributes to creative masters. Each unique - and entirely exclusive - oil painting reinterprets and embellishes the original with fresh colors and/or metallic accents. Granting unprecedented flexibility and brilliance, La Pastiche artwork is an exciting and sophisticated choice for the discerning decorator. Our focus has always been on creating inspiring new options of the utmost quality that remain true to the spirit of the original artist. Frame Description: Burgeon Gold Frame From the Manufacturer OverstockArt is an art manufacturer of framed hand painted oil reproductions and canvas art prints. overstockArt was among the earliest online galleries of hand painted oil paintings and the first to focus on art reproductions of great masters such as Van Gogh, Monet and Klimt. From Impressionist art to Modern Art, overstockArt has the perfect framed canvas art for your home. At overstockArt, we live and breathe the oil paintings that surround us and feel we have a special connection with our customers. Put simply, we are art lovers serving art lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Vbn-ZlNfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Pastiche","source_asin":"B007P2E322","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007P2E322","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007P2E322","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
