window.products.push({"id":760287,"name":"Matsukaze 24 cm (9.5 in) Japanese Chef Knife (Gyuto): Extra Sharp Full Tang Carbon Steel Japanese Blade With Wooden Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616h+DGe8WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications - 24 cm (9.5 in) blade length - 13 cm (5 in) wooden handle - High-carbon steel blade - Forged from a single piece of steel - Full-tang - Designed and manufactured in Japan The chef knife is your kitchen's workhorse and the Matsukaze 24 cm carbon steel blade is up to the challenge. The high quality materials used in this Japanese designed and manufactured blade ensures you'll be using it for decades to come. This super sharp knife is perfect for cutting and chopping meats and vegetables and the hard carbon steel blade will hold it's edge longer than other softer metals. How to Care for Your Carbon Steel Blade If this is your first time using a carbon steel blade there are a few difference between it and stainless steel that you should be aware of: 1. As the name implies, carbon steel is made by adding a small amount of carbon to the steel. The carbon creates a super-hard metal which results in a thinner and sharper blade and a knife that will hold it's edge longer than stainless steel. 2. Over time a carbon steel blade will develop a unique patina and darken as the oils and acids in the foods you're slicing react with the metal. This is normal. To prevent rust spots and to keep your knife in the best possible shape: - Clean your blade with warm soapy water after each use and dry immediately. Never put your knife in the dishwasher. - Apply a thin layer of mineral oil after each use to prevent rusting. - Store you knife in a low humidity environment away from dishwashers and coffee makers. 3. Use a ceramic hone or take it to a professional for sharpening Happy Cooking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616h+DGe8WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Matsukaze","source_asin":"B014Z7UXH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014Z7UXH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014Z7UXH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":760288,"name":"12 Piece King Vanessa Purple and Plum Embroidered Bed in a Bag w/500TC Sheet Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U0pCKLiRL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"This amazing set will transfer your bedroom into a lovely retreat. Elegant embroidered medallions on purple and lavender ground give your bedroom a timeless and elegant appeal. 4 decorative pillows included . Features Color: Purple/Lavender Color: Purple/Lavender Size: King Size: King Machine washable Machine washable Matching curtains available Matching curtains available This set includes:1  Comforter (104\"x92\")2  Shams (20\"x36\"+3\")1  Bedskirt (78\"X80\"+14\")2  Square Cushions(18\"x18\")2  Breakfast Cushions(18\"x12\") Plus 500 Thread Count Cotton Sheets: 2 King pillowcases (20\" x 40\")1 King flat sheet (108\" x 102\")1 King fitted sheet (78\" x 80\" x 15\" pocket depth)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U0pCKLiRL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KingLinen","source_asin":"B00E4WMQ1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E4WMQ1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E4WMQ1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":760289,"name":"Shun Pro 6-1/2-Inch Deba Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/2172BWZ82YL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Shun Pro is kitchen cutlery for the ultimate knife connoisseur. It features the design preferred by professional Japanese chefs -a one sided, beveled edge with a hollow-ground back. The single bevel design design means an incredibly sharp edge that's easy to maintain. Further, the hollow-ground back creates an air pocket, between the blade and the food being cut. The result is less sticking to the blade and less friction damage to the food. Amazon.com Resembling a solid chefs knife, this 6-1/2-inch Japanese Deba slips easily between flesh and bone and offers a broad blade for transporting foods. Ideal for chopping or boning fish, poultry, and other meats; this sturdy mid-sized knife deftly balances strength with ease of use to produce a versatile kitchen tool. Leveraging a 90-year history of superior workmanship, Shun knives are precision-forged in Japan by renowned blade manufacturer KAI. Combining high-carbon stain-resistant \"super steel\" with a one-sided, single-bevel design results in an exceptionally strong, razor-sharp blade. Holding its sharpness longer, a Shun knife offers simplified maintenance on top of its superior performance. Flipping the knife over shows a subtly concave backside created to resist sticking and avoid damaging food. Forming a comfortable D-shaped hold, a fused blend of hardwood veneers and resin comprise the unique ebony Pakkawood handle. A traditionally offset stainless-steel bolster protects knuckles while a steel end-cap finishes the piece. Although dishwasher-safe, hand washing is recommended. This product includes a lifetime warranty. -- Amy Arnold","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/2172BWZ82YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shun","source_asin":"B0000Y7KOA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000Y7KOA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000Y7KOA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
