window.products.push({"id":760452,"name":"Max & Lily Natural Wood Kid and Toddler Square Table, Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AEuYZ-z-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Clean and modern, Max & Lily ’s natural-wood square table is sized just right for toddlers and young children aged 3 and older. Ideal for play, arts and crafts, meals and more, the table seats four kids with ease. Coordinating chairs tuck in below the table surface. Max & Lily ’s tables are constructed solid wood and quality hardware. Max & Lily ’s furniture does not contain pressed cardboard or other inferior materials. The result is excellent quality that lasts. The Max & Lily table features long-lasting, easy to clean, certified low-VOC paints and stains. This durable table can handle vigorous cleanings and play. Max & Lily furniture for kids is designed for fun and function at a reasonable price. Spark independent creativity by allowing kids to set up their own space to draw, learn and store toys and supplies. The square table fits 4 chairs or stools to seat four kids comfortably. The chairs and stools tuck in below the table surface to stay out of the way when not in use. Our largest table, this model is great when you want to accommodate more children. The table measures 19.75” high and 23.75” square--perfect for four pre-school kids. Fast and easy assembly is hassle free with included hex-wrench, bolts, screws, and self-stick felt pad floor protectors. Ready to get out of the nursery and into kid-sized furniture? Max & Lily tables, chairs, stools, and toy storage furniture are perfect for kid’s rooms, family rooms, and playrooms. Max & Lily is the newest member of the Maxwood family of children’s and youth furniture that includes Maxtrix modular kid bedroom furniture, high-style Jackpot bunk beds, and our beautifully designed youth line, Craft Bedrooms. Max & Lily ’s wide range of seating and storage furniture for toddlers and kids can grow with your children and be combined in many different ways to create perfect play, learn and storage solutions for your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AEuYZ-z-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Max & Lily","source_asin":"B01M7UI5T2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M7UI5T2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M7UI5T2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
