window.products.push({"id":760474,"name":"NEQUARE Blackout Window Curtain Panel, Thermal Insulated Solid Grommet Room Darkening Curtain Drapes for Window, Bedroom and Living Room Curtain Home ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OqFqsDNoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft Fabric: Sold as One Panel. The window curtain are constructed with the premium materials of polyester and black liner backing. Soft touch, fade resistant and heavy duty, having a good sense of drape while achieve the excellent performance of light blocking ability. Built-in 8 sliver anti-rust grommets on top of each panel make it easy to hang and slide smoothly. Size&Color: Our window curtain measures 52” wide and 84” long. The solid grommets are 1.6 inch inner diameter each, fits curtain rods up to 1.5\" in diameter. These curtain are available in three colors and sizes separately. Please measure your pole and window size before you purchasing curtains. Each panel sold separately. We recommend that you purchase two panels if in need. Rod is not included. Light Control: This blackout drape panel could reduce 95%-99% of light and UV fays from coming into your windows effectively. Darker color works better than a light one. Perfect drapery option for anyone seeking to block daylight, take a nap, or keep sun glare off your TV. Our thermal insulated curtain help balance your room temperature by preventing summer heat or winter cold from entering your room, which could reduce energy lost through your windows and save your energy budget. Noise reduction: Sound barrier that protect you from disturbing by outside neighbor or traffic noise, keep your room quieter to create a better resting house for a good night sleep. The blackout curtain do not allow a view through and provide complete privacy added to the light blocking function. You can enjoy yourself time or private moments with your family. Suitable for night shift, afternoon naps, late morning sleeper, light-sensitive sleepers or others enjoy the darken room and privacy. Easy Care: Good quality finishing will withstand years of use. Machine washable in gentle cycle and cold water, tumble dry at low temperatures. Mild detergent, do not bleach. Quick ironing or steam clean when needed. This drape may have a little smell when you get it. Please ventilate it to let the odor dissipate and then dress up your window.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OqFqsDNoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEQUARE","source_asin":"B091GKQF7Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091GKQF7Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091GKQF7Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
