window.products.push({"id":760697,"name":"Tovolo Elements XL Ice Cube Tray, Set of 2 Silicone Ice Trays, Extra-Large Ice Cubes for Whiskey, Bourbon, Cocktails & More, BPA-Free & Dishwasher-Saf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.32,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SjjDMkTYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Impressive ice without the fuss. Tovolo Elements XL Ice Cube Tray delivers large cubes in a compact tray, allowing you to replicate your favorite bar drinks from the comfort of your own home. Slow-melting ice prevents dilution, which is perfect for whiskey, bourbon, Scotch, Old Fashioned, and other liquor-heavy cocktails. Large cubes also create a memorable drink experience for guests. Freeze herbs, citrus slices, or berries in the ice for additional flavor infusion. Add to bar drinks, pitchers, punch, or other beverages for long-term chilling power. Compact tray slides easily into tight spaces in the freezer. Trays create extra-large cubes. The cubes’ impressive size help ice melt slowly. The durable food-grade silicone allows easy removal of one or two cubes at a time, so you can enjoy your drinks with as much ice as you want. Freeze juice, coffee, sauce, soup, baby food, or other leftovers to create single-serve portions. Great to use for iced coffee, smoothies, and blended cocktails. Trays are dishwasher safe for easy cleaning. Rinse occasionally with water and vinegar for best results. Made of silicone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SjjDMkTYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B0BJVXPK22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJVXPK22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJVXPK22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
