window.products.push({"id":760725,"name":"Mega Crafts Red Artificial Rose Pomander Kissing Ball 6 Inch, Hanging Ribbon Fabric Flower Décor, Wedding Receptions, Party Decorations, Backdrop Wall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zfi3v36gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"At Last, The Ultimate Artificial Rose Pomander Kissing Ball Collection Has Just Been Released! Ohh, those flowers… They are beautiful, elegant and old time classic. But you don’t feel like spending a small fortune, in order to decorate your home or a special event in your life. Right? If so, then you should keep on reading. We proudly present you the most fashionable flower pomander ball collection. Choose among our many colors and create a stunning decoration both indoors and outdoors. Decorate Your House Under 30 Minutes With Mega Crafts Rose Pomander Kissing Balls! Our fabric rose kissing balls are made from high quality materials and are here to accommodate even your most demanding needs. They come with a hanging ribbon so as to facilitate the hanging process. Hang them over the baby’s crib, on guest’s chairs, on trees, over arches or anywhere that seems convenient. Besides hanging, you could always just place them somewhere. On the TV set, over the fireplace, on the table as centrepiece, in vases and on candle holders, or even in the bathroom! Still Wondering If These Artificial Rose Pomander Balls Are The Right Ones For You? Premium quality fabric artificial rose balls. Set of 1 pomander kissing ball. Attached hanging ribbon. Joyful and perky coral color. Perfect size 6'' wedding flower balls. Not too small, not too bulky. A must have for event planners, designers, artists, diy enthusiasts, home decorators, and you of course. Hang from chairs, use as bridal bouquet, decorate your wedding reception, your home walls or ceiling. Ideal for special ceremonies, graduation, theme parties, birthdays, baby showers, and more! What are you waiting for? Get yours today, while supplies last! Scroll Up & Click Add To Cart!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zfi3v36gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mega Crafts","source_asin":"B07YM2CQ54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YM2CQ54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YM2CQ54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
