window.products.push({"id":760935,"name":"Soldow 36x28 Inch LED Bathroom Vanity Mirror Anti-Fog & Waterproof, Wall Mounted Makeup Mirror with Lights Dimmable High Lumen 3-Color Touch Button Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"DIMMABLE LED --- Led mirror with color and brightness adjustable, touch-controlled with one button. 3 colors for you to choose applying for different situation: natural white(sunlight), cold white(bluish), and warm white(light yellow). Light intensity is dimmable stepless from normal to brightest. SMART TOUCH --- Minimalist design wall vanity mirror of two buttons only: FOG FREE and LIGHTS ADJUSTABLE. Simply touch to switch colors and long press for 3 seconds to dim brightness. DEFOG FOR SHOWER --- Backlit bathroom mirror with anti-fogging function that helps to keep always clear reflection image. Defog button is seperated controled from power switch, you can turn it on/off when necessary, safe and energy-saving, and set you free from mirror defogging troubles after every bath. MEMORY FUNCTION --- Smart remembrance function helps to remember your preferite settings, a lighted bathroom mirror with \"brain\". LEDs will restore to the last use state when powered off and restarted, very convenient in daily use. WATERPROOF & ENVIRONMENTAL MATERIAL --- Adopted copper free environmentally friendly materials matched with silvered reflection layer, and covered by IP54 rated waterproof & moisture-proof housing, keep the lighting mirror safe in wet bathroom environments. EASY INSTALLATION --- Soldow bathroom vanity mirror comes with mounting kit (2 wall mount brackets, 4 expansion bolts, 4 screws, WITHOUT PLUG), and can be easily installed horizontal/vertical in 5-10 minutes. Support wall switch to directly control the light ON/OFF. PACKAGE CONTENT --- 1X LED Mirror Without Plug, 1X Mounting Kit, 1X Instruction. Through various impact tests and continuous improvement, we finally determine the packaging of product, which all-round wrapped the mirror to reduce hit during the trasportation. SINCERE CUSTOMER SERVICE --- All of our products is quality guaranteed, if the product arrives broken, please contact us, all issues will be solved within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soldow","source_asin":"B08QMW6F5D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QMW6F5D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QMW6F5D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
