window.products.push({"id":760994,"name":"Chef'n HerbWand Basting Brush with Ceramic Tray, 2 in 1, White/Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h6EVpV5hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What a baste! Twist fresh herbs into handle of the Herb Wand to give your food natural herb flavor or use the silicone head for quick basting. Includes a ceramic dish to use with oil marinade or fresh butter. Perfect for basting with rosemary, oregano or thyme!HOW TO USE:Unscrew brush top. Insert herbs into wand and twist to lock into place. Use as basting brush for subtle herb ﬂavor.Chef’n tools and gadgets are designed to be powerful in their simplicity, so that you can delight in simple food prep tasks as much as in the moments spent around the table. Less time prepping, more time enjoying. We create products that make experimentation in the kitchen approachable and fun for the chef in all of us. We aim to inspire creativity and shareable experiences in the kitchen. Our tools are approachable so that everyone can experience a healthy-ish lifestyle through intentional at-home food prep. The Chef’n design team focuses on solving problems in the kitchen with innovative, clever solutions. The result is high quality, well designed products that promote and encourage cooking and eating with family and friends at home. We want food prep to be less tedious and more enjoyable for you so that time in your kitchen can be a delicious experience to share. With playful prep and clever cooking let’s make healthy meals and happy kitchens!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h6EVpV5hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef'n","source_asin":"B07VB9XCRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-760994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VB9XCRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VB9XCRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
